  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Now I'm Freakin Out**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **MWYPHM Pony**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2000-07-10** (recommended): soundboard; 28 songs; 125 min [1]. Said about its sound: Spectral analysis suggests both sources underwent lossy compression at some point, despite being FLAC; every known copy of the show is incomplete [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2000-07-10**: source: SBD > H.O.B. Webcast [1]. Also: Chain: soundboard feed to House of Blues webcast, captured, processed in Cool Edit Pro 2.0, then converted to WAV and FLAC; Fileset combines two sources; tracks 27-29 come from an alternate, more compressed source to make the set more complete [1]",
